From 0014d3dde7fc39806e28ac27916ddb12d0a441d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex6357 <73743056+Alex6357@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 21:01:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] optional: reduce yp MAX_RETRIES 20 -> 5 (1021f792f34)

lib/libc/yp/yplib.c: MAX_RETRIES from 20 to 5 (10s sleep between
retries). With wrong NIS config, nss queries used to block 20*10=200s;
after 5 retries (50s) it's almost certainly domain misconfig and should
fail fast. Libc behavioral change affecting all NIS-using programs;
OPTIONAL -- fail-fast vs long-hang tradeoff for the misconfig case.
Conflict-free rebase.
---
 lib/libc/yp/yplib.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/lib/libc/yp/yplib.c b/lib/libc/yp/yplib.c
index 95ed526b2e75..a85389c86df8 100644
--- a/lib/libc/yp/yplib.c
+++ b/lib/libc/yp/yplib.c
@@ -87,7 +87,7 @@ struct dom_binding {
 #ifndef BINDINGDIR
 #define BINDINGDIR "/var/yp/binding"
 #endif
-#define MAX_RETRIES 20
+#define MAX_RETRIES 5
 
 bool_t xdr_ypresp_all_seq(XDR *xdrs, u_long *objp);
 
